東鄙人，不知其便若是，願罷西南夷、滄海而專奉朔方。」上乃許之。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m005-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"張歐","kind":"person","person_id":"0ad_530_yth","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m005-0010","start":10,"end":11,"surface":"弘","kind":"person","person_id":"q69_35n_f3h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m005-0036","start":36,"end":37,"surface":"弘","kind":"person","person_id":"q69_35n_f3h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m005-0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"a05_brz_8xe","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m005-0063","start":63,"end":66,"surface":"朱買臣","kind":"person","person_id":"bvn_k2n_f84","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m005-0068","start":68,"end":69,"surface":"弘","kind":"person","person_id":"q69_35n_f3h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m005-0079","start":79,"end":80,"surface":"弘","kind":"person","person_id":"q69_35n_f3h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m005-0084","start":84,"end":85,"surface":"弘","kind":"person","person_id":"q69_35n_f3h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m005-0117","start":117,"end":118,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"a05_brz_8xe","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin","book_id":"b-shiji-112","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji112-pingjin"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-112","source_id":"s-shiji112-pingjin","source":{"title":"史記／卷112","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷112","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷112&oldid=2089420","revision_id":2089420,"accessed_on":"2026-10-11","extent":"固定數位見證31段；末三段分為後附詔書、班固贊及索隱述贊。","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄